</ol>
<div class="admonition not-prose my-9 rounded-none border-l-2 bg-gray-new-98 py-4 pr-5 pl-[1.125rem] dark:bg-gray-new-8 border-[#2D8665] dark:border-green-52 [&amp;_pre]:px-4 [&amp;_pre]:py-3 [&amp;_pre_code]:text-sm! [&amp;_pre[data-language]]:bg-white! [&amp;_pre[data-language]]:dark:bg-gray-new-8!"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[#2D8665] dark:text-green-52"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="shrink-0"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m12 2 2 2-6.4 6.4-2.8.8.8-2.8z"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12.4 9.2v3.6a1.2 1.2 0 0 1-1.2 1.2h-8A1.2 1.2 0 0 1 2 12.8v-8a1.2 1.2 0 0 1 1.2-1.2h3.6"></path></svg><h4 class="font-mono text-[13px] leading-none font-medium -tracking-snug uppercase">note</h4></div><div class="admonition-text mt-2.5 text-base leading-normal tracking-extra-tight text-gray-new-20 dark:text-gray-new-85 [&amp;_a]:rounded-sm [&amp;_li]:text-base [&amp;_li]:leading-snug [&amp;_li]:tracking-extra-tight [&amp;_ul]:my-0 [&amp;_ol]:my-0"><p>The following sections primarily detail the creation of Neon resources. To manage existing resources, use the <code>tofu import</code> command or <code>import</code> blocks. More information can be found in the <a class="" href="#import-existing-neon-resources-with-opentofu">Import Existing Neon Resources</a> section.</p></div></div>
<h2 id="manage-neon-resources-with-opentofu" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Manage Neon resources with OpenTofu</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#manage-neon-resources-with-opentofu" aria-label="Link to Manage Neon resources with OpenTofu"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
<p>This section provides examples of how to manage Neon resources using OpenTofu. You can create and manage projects, branches, endpoints, roles, databases, and more.</p>
<h3 id="managing-projects" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Managing projects</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#managing-projects" aria-label="Link to Managing projects"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
<div class="admonition not-prose my-9 rounded-none border-l-2 bg-gray-new-98 py-4 pr-5 pl-[1.125rem] dark:bg-gray-new-8 border-[#E2301D] dark:border-[#FF5645] [&amp;_pre]:px-4 [&amp;_pre]:py-3 [&amp;_pre_code]:text-sm! [&amp;_pre[data-language]]:bg-white! [&amp;_pre[data-language]]:dark:bg-gray-new-8!"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[#E2301D] dark:text-[#FF5645]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="shrink-0"><path fill="currentColor" d="M8.005 11.999a.833.833 0 1 0 0-1.667.833.833 0 0 0 0 1.667"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-miterlimit="10" stroke-width="1.333" d="M8 8.667V6M6.782 2.707l-5.266 9.188A1.405 1.405 0 0 0 2.736 14h10.532a1.405 1.405 0 0 0 1.22-2.105L9.22 2.707a1.405 1.405 0 0 0-2.439 0Z"></path></svg><h4 class="font-mono text-[13px] leading-none font-medium -tracking-snug uppercase">warning</h4></div><div class="admonition-text mt-2.5 text-base leading-normal tracking-extra-tight text-gray-new-20 dark:text-gray-new-85 [&amp;_a]:rounded-sm [&amp;_li]:text-base [&amp;_li]:leading-snug [&amp;_li]:tracking-extra-tight [&amp;_ul]:my-0 [&amp;_ol]:my-0"><p>Always set the <code>org_id</code> attribute when creating a <code>neon_project</code>. You can find your Organization ID in the Neon Console under Account Settings → Organization settings.</p><p><span aria-owns="rmiz-modal-" data-rmiz=""><span data-rmiz-content="not-found" style="visibility:visible"><img alt="finding your organization ID from the settings page" loading="lazy" width="704" height="447" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent;width:100%;height:100%" src="/docs/manage/orgs_id.png?dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7"/></span></span></p><p>Omitting <code>orgId</code> can cause resources to be created in the wrong organization or produce duplicate projects, and subsequent <code>tofu plan</code> / <code>tofu apply</code> runs may attempt destructive changes (including deletions). To avoid this, explicitly provide <code>orgId</code> when defining your project as shown in the example below.</p></div></div>
<p>A Neon project is the top-level container for your Postgres databases, branches, and endpoints.</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="terraform"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">resource</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> &quot;neon_project&quot; &quot;my_app_project&quot; {</span></span>
